{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike \u00d7 Battle Automation<strong>! Test Your Wit and Ingenuity on an Epic Adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578570/extras/kemo.gif?t=1744188962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Set Off on a Grand Adventure!!</strong> <br>Sneak away from Mama and embark on an exciting journey! But be careful\u2014danger lurks around every corner! Plan your battle strategies and guide this adorable little one to victory!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578570/extras/asasin.gif?t=1744188962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Automate the battle!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine skills and conditions to automate combat! Think strategically and come up with the best plan to match the situation!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578570/extras/Sprite-0021.gif?t=1744188962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Two Adventures Are the Same!!</strong> <br>Enemies, skills, and events change every time you play! Keep exploring, gain experience, and refine your strategies!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578570/extras/Sprite-0022.gif?t=1744188962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your Growth and Ingenuity Will Decide Your Fate!!</strong> <br>Everyone starts their adventure on equal footing. But through experience, <i>you</i> will become stronger! Use your wits and strategy to carve your own path!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the demo, you can play up to the second stage!!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.ak